OL,3,GNEWSACharity shop loses money to
OL,4,Ashoplifting every day
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout #20 of stock is being stolen from
OL,7,Fa Cancer Research UK charity shop in
OL,8,FPeterborough every day, according to
OL,9,Fits manager.
OL,11,FMarina Staudze said shoplifting was a
OL,12,F"major problem" for the store on
OL,13,FWestgate.
OL,15,FPolice figures showed there were 578
OL,16,Fshoplifting incidents reported in the
OL,17,Fcity centre in the year to July - a
OL,18,Frise of 15.4% on the year before.
OL,20,FA spokesman for Cambridgeshire Police
OL,21,Fencouraged all businesses affected to
OL,22,Freport each theft.
